You MAY:

- keep and serve unmodified copies of these files as part of building,
  running, or redistributing Cherry itself (for example, the copy the
  cherrybomb theme ships);
- display the assets unmodified when referring to the Cherry project
  (screenshots, articles, talks, package listings, links to
  cherrybomb.dev).

You MAY NOT, without prior written permission:

- use these assets, or modified versions of them, as the logo, icon,
  mascot, or branding of your own project, product, site, or service;
- sell them or use them on merchandise;
- use them in a way that suggests your work is affiliated with or
  endorsed by the Cherry project.

If you build a site with the cherrybomb theme, replace the shipped mark
and icons with your own artwork; the theme works fine without them.

